senses.gloss:
आ-√ नी P. -नयति (1. pl. आ॑-नयामसि, AV. v, 25, 8; Impv. 2. sg. आ॑-नय, 3. sg. आ॑-नयतु; pf. आ॑-निनाय, AV. v, 17, 2, and आ-निना॑य, RV. viii, 21, 9 ; inf. -नेतवै॑, ŚBr. ii, 1, 14, 16) Ā. (1. sg. -नये, R.)
to lead towards or near;
to bring, carry to a place (acc. or loc.);
to fetch, RV.; AV.; SV.; ŚBr.; MBh.; R.; Śak. &c.;
 (perf. periphr. -नयामास, MBh. iii, 2282) to cause to bring or fetch;
to bring back or take back, MBh.; R.;
to pour in, mix in RV.; VS.; ŚBr. &c.;
to bring any one to, reduce to any state, MBh.;
to deduce, calculate;
to use, employ, prove:
Caus. P. -नाययति, to cause to be brought or fetched or led near, MBh.; R.; Ragh.; Kathās. &c.:
Desid. -निनीषति, to intend or wish to bring near, BhP. x, 89, 42.
